  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN is by design a heterogeneous institution with member states comprising diverse cultural backgrounds, views and economic interests. The Friendship group provides a space for member state delegates to learn about key SRHR issues and strengthen dialogue and relationships.</narrative>
